# ColdTrack Edge

Cold chain monitoring for refrigerated fruit transport (mango and grape from the São Francisco Valley). An ESP32-C3 sensor node measures temperature and humidity inside the cargo container, classifies the reading according to the cargo range, signals alerts on the board, and sends telemetry to an Azure API. A web dashboard displays readings, alerts, and each company's records.

4th-semester Integrative Project, Faculdade Senac PE, 2026.2.

The project consists of two repositories:

| repository | contents |
|---|---|
| [projeto-integrador-4-periodo](https://github.com/mbalbuquerque/projeto-integrador-4-periodo) (this one) | ESP32-C3 firmware, API (Azure Functions, Python), infrastructure, climate analysis, and documentation |
| [Front-End-pi](https://github.com/mbalbuquerque/Front-End-pi) | web dashboard (React + Vite) deployed on Azure Storage |

Both are deployed from the `everson` branch (see [Deployment](#deployment)).

